questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Doomlord Minion Horde[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then wipe out five waves of Doomlord base minions."
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_offer,quests,,false,"Reports of Doomlord minions massing in the area. Trigger the rally, drop the lure, and brace for five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_statement,quests,,false,Wipe out all five waves of Doomlord minions.
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Doomlord Minion Horde[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMinion_completion,quests,,false,Good work. Five waves down. Here's your reward.
itemAECDoomlordContract_Minion,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Doomlord Contract | Minion Horde[-]
itemAECDoomlordContract_Minion_desc,,,false,Contract: Eliminate five waves of Doomlord base minions.
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Minion_msg,,,false,Doomlord minions are closing in — get ready!
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Grenadier Horde[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the signal lure, then eliminate five waves of Doomlord Grenadiers."
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_offer,quests,,false,"Intel says Doomlord is sending Grenadier squads your way. Activate the rally, place the signal lure, then hold for five waves. Think you can handle that?"
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_statement,quests,,false,I'll arm the signal lure and wipe out all five Grenadier waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Grenadier Horde[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadier_completion,quests,,false,Not bad. Those Grenadiers won't be throwing any more surprises.
aecQuestSignalLure,blocks,Block,false,AEC Signal Lure
aecQuestSignalLureDesc,blocks,Block Desc,false,Quest item. Place this lure after activating the rally point to draw the enemy waves to your position.
aecQuestAllInOneLure,blocks,Block,false,All-In-One Lure
aecQuestAllInOneLureDesc,blocks,Block Desc,false,Quest item. Place this reinforced lure to trigger The All-In-One Hunt and pull every marked boss pair onto your position.
aecQuestRelay,blocks,Block,false,[FFD700]AEC[-] Contract Relay
aecQuestRelayDesc,blocks,Block Desc,false,A salvaged radio converted into an AEC contract terminal. Use it to summon the Huntmaster and access AEC-only contracts.
aecPortableAmmoWorkshop,blocks,Block,false,[00E5FF]AEC[-] Portable Ammo Workshop
aecPortableAmmoWorkshopDesc,blocks,Block Desc,false,"Portable AEC ammo bench with a table saw shell. Place it, craft unlocked workbench munitions."
dialogAECQuestGiverStart,dialogs,,false,State your echelon. I only handle AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuest,dialogs,,false,Show me the AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier1,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 1 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier2,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 2 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier3,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 3 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier4,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 4 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier5,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 5 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestTier6,dialogs,,false,Show me the Tier 6 AEC contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestList,dialogs,,false,Pick your echelon. The deepest page also carries the legendary contracts.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestInProgress,dialogs,,false,I'm already on a contract.
dialogAECQuestGiverQuestInProgressNext,dialogs,,false,Then finish it and come back. I do not stack AEC work.
dialogAECQuestGiverDisableQuesting,dialogs,,false,No contracts right now.
dialogAECQuestGiverDisableQuestingNext,dialogs,,false,Questing is currently blocked for you. Clear that first.
