questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Rocket Corps[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then break five Doomlord Rocket waves. Stay spread out."
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_offer,quests,,false,"Rocket troops incoming. Trigger the rally, drop the lure, and prepare for five brutal waves. Do not cluster."
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_statement,quests,,false,and neutralize the Rocket Corps.
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Rocket Corps[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeRocket_completion,quests,,false,Good job. Fewer targets but that blast radius doesn't mess around.
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Pistol Squad[-]
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then clear five waves of Doomlord Pistol troopers. Fast and numerous."
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_offer,quests,,false,"Pistol squads are deploying in your sector. Trigger the rally, set the lure, and survive five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_statement,quests,,false,"Go in, activate the rally, place the lure, and clear all five Pistol waves."
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Pistol Squad[-]
questAECDoomlordHordePistol_completion,quests,,false,Pistol squad neutralized. Nice work.
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Shotgun Rush[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against three waves of Doomlord Shotgun troopers."
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_offer,quests,,false,Shotgun rush is inbound at a local site. Defend the position across three waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_statement,quests,,false,Get to the site and hold against the Shotgun rush.
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgun_completion,quests,,false,The rush is over. Excellent defense.
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Sniper Nest[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then clear five waves of Doomlord Snipers. Stay mobile and end them."
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_offer,quests,,false,"High-value snipers are digging in. Trigger the rally, set the lure, and clear five waves before they lock down the area."
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_statement,quests,,false,"Move in, activate the rally, place the lure, and clear the Sniper Nest across five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Sniper Nest[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeSniper_completion,quests,,false,Nest cleared. Good work staying on the move.
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Magnum Guard[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against three waves of Doomlord Magnum Guards."
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_offer,quests,,false,Magnum Guard deploying on a site. Three tough waves — hold your ground.
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Magnum Guard waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnum_completion,quests,,false,Magnum Guard repelled. Well held.
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Knife Runners[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against three waves of Doomlord Knife Runners."
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_offer,quests,,false,Knife runners inbound at a local site. Three waves of close-quarters maniacs.
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three waves of Knife Runners.
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeKnife_completion,quests,,false,Not a scratch. Those runners never had a chance.
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_name,quests,,false,[FFAA00]Demo Squad[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T4 Mixed Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then survive five mixed waves of Grenadiers and Rockets. Every single target is lethal."
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_offer,quests,,false,"Demo squad deployment. Trigger the rally, drop the lure, and brace for mixed grenades and rockets. Keep your distance."
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_statement,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, and neutralize the Demo Squad across five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FFAA00]Demo Squad[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeDemo_completion,quests,,false,Demo squad eliminated. Still got all your fingers?
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_name,quests,,false,[FFAA00]Frontline Assault[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T4 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against three frontline waves of Doomlord Shotgun and Knife troops."
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_offer,quests,,false,Close-range assault: Shotguns and Knives together. The site won't last long without you.
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_statement,quests,,false,Hold the site against three Frontline Assault waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeFrontline_completion,quests,,false,Frontline repelled. Brutal fighting. Well done.
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_name,quests,,false,[FFAA00]Overwatch[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T4 Mixed Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then dismantle five waves of Snipers and Magnums in Overwatch formation."
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_offer,quests,,false,"Overwatch team spotted. Trigger the rally, set the lure, and watch your sight lines through five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_statement,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, and dismantle the Overwatch formation across five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FFAA00]Overwatch[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeOverwatch_completion,quests,,false,Overwatch neutralized. Outstanding target acquisition.
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_name,quests,,false,[FFAA00]Fire Team[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T4 Mixed Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then eliminate five waves of Pistols and Magnums operating as a coordinated fire team."
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_offer,quests,,false,"Fire team inbound. Trigger the rally, drop the lure, and hold through five waves of coordinated pressure."
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_statement,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, and eliminate the Fire Team across five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FFAA00]Fire Team[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeFireTeam_completion,quests,,false,Fire Team down. Clean execution.
questAECDoomlordHunt_name,quests,,false,[FF0000]HUNT: The Doomlord[-]
questAECDoomlordHunt_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T5 Boss Hunt
questAECDoomlordHunt_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, survive six mixed waves of Doomlord elites, then face Demolishman himself."
questAECDoomlordHunt_offer,quests,,false,"Big contract. Trigger the rally, set the lure, survive six mixed elite troops, then face Demolishman yourself."
questAECDoomlordHunt_statement,quests,,false,"survive six waves, then kill Demolishman himself."
questAECDoomlordHunt_response,quests,,false,AEC BOSS FIGHT - [FF0000]HUNT: The Doomlord[-]
questAECDoomlordHunt_completion,quests,,false,Impressive. Demolishman is dead. The Doomlord era is over.
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave1,quests,,false,Wave 1: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave2,quests,,false,Wave 2: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave3,quests,,false,Wave 3: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave4,quests,,false,Wave 4: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave5,quests,,false,Wave 5: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_wave6,quests,,false,Wave 6: Survive 45 seconds
questAECDoomlordHunt_obj_kill,quests,,false,Kill the Doomlord: Demolishman
questAECWaveChallenge_name,quests,,false,[00E5FF]100 Waves Challenge[-]
questAECWaveChallenge_subtitle,quests,,false,AEC Endurance Contract
questAECWaveChallenge_description,quests,,false,"Deploy the signal lure, lock down the area, and survive all 100 assault waves. Standard waves advance every 30 seconds. Every fifth wave becomes a 2 minute hold before the next assault begins."
questAECWaveChallenge_offer,quests,,false,"AEC has stabilized this endurance trial into a formal contract. Place the lure, survive each wave, and hold the line through every fifth-wave lockdown."
questAECWaveChallenge_statement,quests,,false,"I'll deploy the lure, survive all 100 timed waves, and finish the endurance contract cleanly."
questAECWaveChallenge_response,quests,,false,AEC CONTRACT - [00E5FF]100 WAVE ENDURANCE[-]
questAECWaveChallenge_completion,quests,,false,Endurance contract complete. All 100 waves cleared.
buffAECWaveChallengeNextWave,,,false,Next challenge wave
buffAECWaveChallengeNextWaveDesc,,,false,The next wave will arrive when this countdown ends.
questAECDoomlordSiege_name,quests,,false,[FF0000]SIEGE: The Doomlord[-]
questAECDoomlordSiege_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T5 Boss Siege
questAECDoomlordSiege_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then survive four waves of Doomlord elites and kill Demolishman when he arrives."
questAECDoomlordSiege_offer,quests,,false,Demolishman is personally leading a siege. Hold the position through four waves and take him down when he shows.
questAECDoomlordSiege_statement,quests,,false,Hold the fortified site against four waves then kill Demolishman.
questAECDoomlordSiege_response,quests,,false,AEC BOSS FIGHT ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordSiege_completion,quests,,false,Siege broken. Demolishman is dead. Remarkable.
questAECDoomlordSiege_obj_kill,quests,,false,Kill the Doomlord: Demolishman
questAECDoomlord_obj_wave1,quests,,false,Wave 1: Eliminate Doomlord Forces
questAECDoomlord_obj_wave2,quests,,false,Wave 2: Eliminate Doomlord Forces
questAECDoomlord_obj_wave3,quests,,false,Wave 3: Eliminate Doomlord Forces
questAECDoomlord_obj_wave4,quests,,false,Wave 4: Survive the Doomlord assault
questAECDoomlord_obj_wave5,quests,,false,Wave 5: Eliminate Doomlord Forces
