itemAECDoomlordContract_Knife_desc,,,false,Contract: Stop five waves of Doomlord Knife Runners in the wild.
itemAECDoomlordContract_Demo_desc,,,false,Contract: Survive five waves of the explosive Demo Squad (Grenadiers + Rockets).
itemAECDoomlordContract_Frontline_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a position against three waves of Frontline assault troops (Shotgun + Knife).
itemAECDoomlordContract_Overwatch_desc,,,false,Contract: Break through five waves of Overwatch suppression (Sniper + Magnum).
itemAECDoomlordContract_FireTeam_desc,,,false,Contract: Engage and eliminate five waves of coordinated Fire Teams (Pistol + Magnum).
itemAECDoomlordContract_Hunt_desc,,,false,Contract: Survive six mixed elite waves then kill Doomlord Demolishman himself.
itemAECDoomlordContract_Siege_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a fortified location through four elite waves then slay Demolishman.
itemAECDoomlordContract_100waveschallenge_desc,,,false,Contract: survive the 100 Waves Challenge against the Grenadier as the timer drops from 60 seconds to 20.
itemAECDoomlordContract_100waveschallenge_minion_desc,,,false,Contract: survive the 100 Waves Challenge against the Doomlord Minion as the timer drops from 60 seconds to 20.
itemAECDoomlordContract_100waveschallenge_minion02_desc,,,false,Contract: survive the 100 Waves Challenge against the Doomlord Minion02 Rocket as the timer drops from 60 seconds to 20.
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Grenadier_msg,,,false,Grenadier squad closing in — watch for grenades!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Rocket_msg,,,false,Rocket troopers inbound — find cover NOW!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Pistol_msg,,,false,Pistol squad converging on your position!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Shotgun_msg,,,false,Shotgun rush inbound — they won't stop!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Sniper_msg,,,false,Sniper nest established. Watch your head!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Magnum_msg,,,false,Magnum guard deploying — heavy fire incoming!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Knife_msg,,,false,Knife runners inbound — get them before they reach you!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Demo_msg,,,false,Demo squad incoming — Grenadiers AND Rockets. Spread out!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Frontline_msg,,,false,Frontline assault — Shotgun and Knife troops converging!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Overwatch_msg,,,false,Overwatch deployed — Snipers and Magnums on high ground!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_FireTeam_msg,,,false,Fire team deployed — Pistols and Magnums closing in!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Hunt_msg,,,false,You have entered Doomlord territory. Survive to face him!
eventAECDoomlordArrival_Siege_msg,,,false,Doomlord forces are laying siege! Hold position!
eventAECWaveChallengeArrival_msg,,,false,AEC bonus contract armed. Hold the lure and prepare for the challenge.
eventAECGenericAmmoDrop_TieredRewards,,,false,AEC ammo supply drop inbound.
eventAECDoomlordWave1_msg,,,false,WAVE 1: Doomlord forces advancing!
eventAECDoomlordWave2_msg,,,false,WAVE 2: More Doomlord troops incoming!
eventAECDoomlordWave3_msg,,,false,WAVE 3: Keep holding — more are coming!
eventAECDoomlordWave4_msg,,,false,WAVE 4: Another Doomlord assault is crashing into your line!
eventAECDoomlordWave5_msg,,,false,WAVE 5: Final push. Break the last Doomlord wave!
eventAECDoomlordWave6_msg,,,false,FINAL WAVE: The last Doomlord elite wave is here. Boss incoming next!
eventAECWaveChallengeStart_msg,,,false,Wave challenge active. Survive each wave as the timer drops every five waves from 60 seconds to 20.
eventAECWaveChallengeWave_msg,,,false,CONTRACT WAVE: Enemies are inbound. Grab the supply drops before the next timer expires.
