eventAECDoomlordBossSpawn_msg,,,false,THE DOOMLORD ARRIVES — Demolishman himself is here!
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Shotgun Rush — Open Field[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then stop five waves of Doomlord Shotgun troopers in open terrain."
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_offer,quests,,false,"Shotgun rush in the open. Trigger the rally, set the lure, and hold through five waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_statement,quests,,false,and wipe out five waves of Shotgun troopers.
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Shotgun Rush — Open Field[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeShotgunWild_completion,quests,,false,Open field cleared. Nice work.
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Magnum Patrol[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then intercept five waves of Magnum Guard units patrolling in the open."
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_offer,quests,,false,"Magnum patrol spotted in the open. Trigger the rally, drop the lure, and prepare for five waves of heavy firepower."
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_statement,quests,,false,and wipe five Magnum patrol waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Magnum Patrol[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMagnumWild_completion,quests,,false,Magnum patrol eliminated. Well done.
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Knife Ambush[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Horde
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_description,quests,,false,"Activate the rally, place the lure, then survive five waves of Doomlord Knife Runners in the open."
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_offer,quests,,false,"Knife runners in the open. Trigger the rally, set the lure, and keep moving through five fast waves."
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_statement,quests,,false,and cut down five waves of Knife Runners.
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_response,quests,,false,AEC HORDE - [FF4500]Knife Ambush[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeKnifeWild_completion,quests,,false,Ambush broken. Those runners never had a chance.
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Grenadier Defense[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against waves of Doomlord Grenadiers."
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_offer,quests,,false,Grenadiers are hitting a site. Three waves. Spread out — don't cluster.
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Grenadier waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_response,quests,,false,AEC POI DEFENSE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeGrenadierPOI_completion,quests,,false,Position defended. Grenadiers neutralized.
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Rocket Defense[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against waves of Doomlord Rocket troopers."
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_offer,quests,,false,Rockets incoming at a site. Fewer of them but each one can level the place. Three waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Rocket waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_response,quests,,false,AEC POI DEFENSE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeRocketPOI_completion,quests,,false,Site held. Rocket Corps repelled.
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Pistol Defense[-]
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against waves of Doomlord Pistol squads."
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_offer,quests,,false,Pistol squads converging on a site. Three waves of fast movers. Get there quickly.
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Pistol Squad waves.
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_response,quests,,false,AEC POI DEFENSE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordePistolPOI_completion,quests,,false,Pistol squads repelled. Position secure.
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Sniper Defense[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against waves of Doomlord Snipers."
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_offer,quests,,false,Snipers are locking down a site. Three waves. Keep your head down.
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Sniper waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_response,quests,,false,AEC POI DEFENSE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeSniperPOI_completion,quests,,false,Snipers cleared. Site secured.
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_name,quests,,false,[FF4500]Minion Defense[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Doomlord T3 Defense
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_description,quests,,false,"Clear the POI first, then hold against waves of Doomlord minions."
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_offer,quests,,false,Minion swarm at a site. Three waves. Basic enemies but they come in numbers.
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_statement,quests,,false,Defend the site against three Doomlord Minion waves.
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_response,quests,,false,AEC POI DEFENSE ([DECEA3]{poi.distance} {poi.direction}[-]) [FF9900]{poi.name}[-]
questAECDoomlordHordeMinionPOI_completion,quests,,false,Minions repelled. Site held.
