itemAECDoomlordContract_GrenadierPOI_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a location against three waves of Doomlord Grenadiers.
itemAECDoomlordContract_RocketPOI,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Doomlord Contract | Rocket Defense[-]
itemAECDoomlordContract_RocketPOI_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a location against three reduced waves of Doomlord Rocket troopers.
itemAECDoomlordContract_PistolPOI,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Doomlord Contract | Pistol Defense[-]
itemAECDoomlordContract_PistolPOI_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a location against three waves of Doomlord Pistol squads.
itemAECDoomlordContract_SniperPOI,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Doomlord Contract | Sniper Defense[-]
itemAECDoomlordContract_SniperPOI_desc,,,false,Contract: Defend a location against three waves of Doomlord Snipers.
