questAECDoomlordLastAssault_obj_wave7,quests,,false,Wave 7: Survive 80 seconds
questAECDoomlordLastAssault_obj_wave8,quests,,false,Wave 8 — Eliminate Rocket Corps
questAECDoomlordLastAssault_obj_boss,quests,,false,Kill the Doomlord — Demolishman
eventAECDoomlordArrival_LastAssault_msg,,,false,| [FF0000]THE LAST ASSAULT:[-] Seven waves of Doomlord forces — then the boss himself. No retreat!
eventAECDoomlordLastAssault_Wave1_msg,,,false,| [FF4500]LAST ASSAULT — WAVE 1:[-] Doomlord Minions — the vanguard begins!
eventAECDoomlordLastAssault_Wave2_msg,,,false,| [FF4500]LAST ASSAULT — WAVE 2:[-] Pistol Squad — quick and relentless!
