eventAECGhostArrival_LanternMarch_msg,gameevents,,,Lanterns sway in the dark. A ghost march is closing in.
eventAECGhostArrival_RestlessRush_msg,gameevents,,,The night stirs. Fast ghost minions are rushing your position.
eventAECGhostArrival_EchoVolley_msg,gameevents,,,You hear stones and screams in the dark. The volley is coming.
eventAECGhostArrival_HollowPatrol_msg,gameevents,,,A hollow patrol is roaming nearby. Hold until every ghost falls.
eventAECGhostArrival_MidnightCarnival_msg,gameevents,,,The carnival lights are dead but the ghosts still dance.
eventAECGhostArrival_GraveyardWatch_msg,gameevents,,,Keep watch. The graveyard dead are moving on this position.
eventAECGhostArrival_CarnivalDead_msg,gameevents,,,The dead carnival has found this place. Defend it through the night.
eventAECGhostArrival_ShriekingStones_msg,gameevents,,,Shrieking stones cut through the dark. Ranged ghosts incoming.
eventAECGhostArrival_DeadShift_msg,gameevents,,,The dead shift has clocked in. Hold the site until dawn or death.
eventAECGhostArrival_LanternBreach_msg,gameevents,,,Ghost lanterns are breaching the perimeter. Get ready.
eventAECGhostArrival_LostProcession_msg,gameevents,,,A lost procession is crossing the night. Break it before it surrounds you.
eventAECGhostArrival_BrokenVigil_msg,gameevents,,,The vigil is broken. Mixed ghost forces are coming for this place.
eventAECGhostArrival_HauntedGrounds_msg,gameevents,,,The ground itself is haunted tonight. Clear the waves before they spread.
eventAECGhostArrival_HollowParade_msg,gameevents,,,A hollow parade is marching on the objective. Do not let it pass.
eventAECGhostArrival_Stalk_msg,gameevents,,,Ghost hunt contract active. Survive the escorts and draw The Ghost out.
eventAECGhostArrival_Ward_msg,gameevents,,,Ghost defense contract active. Hold the site until The Ghost breaches it.
eventAECGhostArrival_Hunt_msg,gameevents,,,The hunt begins under cover of night. Push through the servants and kill The Ghost.
eventAECGhostArrival_NightDefense_msg,gameevents,,,Defense: The Ghost contract active. Hold this position until The Ghost arrives.
eventAECGhostArrival_PhantomCourt_msg,gameevents,,,The Phantom Court gathers. Survive the royal procession and slay its ruler.
eventAECGhostArrival_HauntedSiege_msg,gameevents,,,A haunted siege has begun. Hold this ground until the Ghost is dead.
eventAECGhostWave_Lantern1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Spectral lantern bearers are closing in.
eventAECGhostWave_Lantern2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: More spectral lanterns advance through the dark.
eventAECGhostWave_Lantern3_msg,gameevents,,,Final spectral lantern wave. Put the march down.
eventAECGhostWave_Restless1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Restless ghosts rush the zone.
eventAECGhostWave_Restless2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The rush gets faster.
eventAECGhostWave_Restless3_msg,gameevents,,,Final rush. Cut them down before they break through.
eventAECGhostWave_Volley1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Bowler ghosts and screamers are firing from the dark.
eventAECGhostWave_Volley2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The ghost volley intensifies.
eventAECGhostWave_Volley3_msg,gameevents,,,Final volley. Silence the screamers and stone throwers.
eventAECGhostWave_Patrol1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: A hollow patrol enters the area.
eventAECGhostWave_Patrol2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: More of the patrol emerges from the gloom.
eventAECGhostWave_Patrol3_msg,gameevents,,,Final patrol wave. End the roaming dead.
eventAECGhostWave_Carnival1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The carnival dead spill out of the dark.
eventAECGhostWave_Carnival2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The midnight carnival grows louder.
eventAECGhostWave_Carnival3_msg,gameevents,,,Final carnival wave. End the performance.
eventAECGhostWave_Graveyard1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Graveyard watchers are closing in.
eventAECGhostWave_Graveyard2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The graves will not stay shut.
eventAECGhostWave_Graveyard3_msg,gameevents,,,Final graveyard wave. Hold the cemetery line.
eventAECGhostWave_Procession1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The lost procession advances.
eventAECGhostWave_Procession2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The procession deepens.
eventAECGhostWave_Procession3_msg,gameevents,,,Final procession wave. Break the line of the dead.
eventAECGhostWave_Grounds1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Haunted ground forces are pushing in.
eventAECGhostWave_Grounds2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The haunted ground grows more hostile.
eventAECGhostWave_Grounds3_msg,gameevents,,,Final grounds wave. Purge the haunted earth.
eventAECGhostWave_Stalk1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The Ghost sends hunters ahead.
eventAECGhostWave_Stalk2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The stalking force tightens the circle.
eventAECGhostWave_Stalk3_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 3: The stalking force closes in.
eventAECGhostWave_Stalk4_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 4: The hunters press from every side.
eventAECGhostWave_Stalk5_msg,gameevents,,,Final hunt wave. The Ghost is almost here.
eventAECGhostWave_Hunt1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Elite ghost minions are advancing.
eventAECGhostWave_Hunt2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The elite escort grows heavier.
eventAECGhostWave_Hunt3_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 3: The elite escort keeps advancing.
eventAECGhostWave_Hunt4_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 4: The night elite press the attack.
eventAECGhostWave_Hunt5_msg,gameevents,,,Final elite wave. Brace for the Ghost.
eventAECGhostWave_Court1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The Phantom Court sends its first rank.
eventAECGhostWave_Court2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The court answers with more dead nobles.
eventAECGhostWave_Court3_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 3: Another royal rank marches from the dark.
eventAECGhostWave_Court4_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 4: The Phantom Court closes ranks.
eventAECGhostWave_Court5_msg,gameevents,,,Final court wave. Break the last rank before The Ghost arrives.
eventAECGhostBossSpawn_Stalk_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: The Ghost has stepped into the hunt.
eventAECGhostBossSpawn_Ward_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: The Ghost breaches the warded ground.
