eventAECHeadlessArrival_BloodyMarch_msg,gameevents,,,Blood is already on the ground. A Headless march is closing in.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_BloodBreach_msg,gameevents,,,A Headless breach has found the site. Hold until the last one drops.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_MixedAssault_msg,gameevents,,,A mixed assault is forming. Ghosts and Headless minions are pushing the zone.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_Hunt_msg,gameevents,,,The hunt begins. Break the Headless escorts and drag the boss into the open.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_Defense_msg,gameevents,,,Headless defense contract active. Hold the ground until the boss crawls in.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_DoubleBreak_msg,gameevents,,,Two Headless bosses are bound to this hunt. Break the escort before both arrive.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_GhostCourt_msg,gameevents,,,Ghosts and Headless dead answer the same call tonight. Survive the court and kill both rulers.
eventAECHeadlessArrival_BloodBroodAndGallows_msg,gameevents,,,"Blood, brood and gallows converge. Survive the mixed waves and finish the three bosses together."
eventAECHeadlessWave_March1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The first Headless rank is dragging itself toward you.
eventAECHeadlessWave_March2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: More Headless bodies stagger into the breach.
eventAECHeadlessWave_March3_msg,gameevents,,,Final march wave. Put the bleeding line down.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Breach1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Headless intruders are inside the perimeter.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Breach2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The breach deepens with heavier Headless bodies.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Breach3_msg,gameevents,,,Final breach wave. Clear the site before it collapses.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedPatrol1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Ghosts drift in beside Headless scouts.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedPatrol2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: More mixed scouts are circling the lure.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedPatrol3_msg,gameevents,,,Final mixed patrol wave. Finish the stragglers.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedAssault1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The mixed assault hits hard and fast.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedAssault2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: Ghosts screen the Headless charge.
eventAECHeadlessWave_MixedAssault3_msg,gameevents,,,Final assault wave. Clear the mixed line before it folds on you.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Procession1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The Headless procession drags blades and shields into the dark.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Procession2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The procession thickens with armored corpses.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Procession3_msg,gameevents,,,Final procession wave. Break the Headless line.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Shattered1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Ghost and Headless lines merge into one procession.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Shattered2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The shattered parade closes ranks.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Shattered3_msg,gameevents,,,Final shattered wave. Cut down the mixed dead.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Hunt1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Elite Headless escorts are advancing.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Hunt2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The escort grows heavier.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Hunt3_msg,gameevents,,,Final elite wave. Brace for the Headless boss.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Court1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: The first Headless rank drags itself into the court.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Court2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: More Headless bodies pile into the court.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Court3_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 3: The court refuses to break.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Court4_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 4: The Headless court closes ranks with heavier dead.
eventAECHeadlessWave_Court5_msg,gameevents,,,Final court wave. Break the last rank before the rulers arrive.
eventAECHeadlessWave_GhostCourt1_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 1: Ghosts and Headless dead take the field together.
eventAECHeadlessWave_GhostCourt2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The mixed court adds more bodies to the line.
eventAECHeadlessWave_GhostCourt3_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 3: The court grows louder and bloodier.
eventAECHeadlessWave_GhostCourt4_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 4: The mixed court closes ranks.
eventAECHeadlessWave_GhostCourt5_msg,gameevents,,,Final mixed court wave. Break it before both bosses arrive.
eventAECBloodBroodWave1_msg,gameevents,,,"Wave 1: Headless dead, Executioner minions and Mykir brood converge."
eventAECBloodBroodWave2_msg,gameevents,,,Wave 2: The mixed minion line closes in from every side.
eventAECBloodBroodWave3_msg,gameevents,,,Final mixed wave. Clear the field before the bosses descend.
eventAECHeadlessBossSpawn_Hunt_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: The Headless answers your lure.
eventAECHeadlessBossSpawn_Defense_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: The Headless breaches the defense in person.
eventAECHeadlessBossSpawn_DoubleBreak_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: Both Headless bosses have entered the hunt.
eventAECHeadlessBossSpawn_GhostCourt_msg,gameevents,,,BOSS: The Ghost and The Headless enter the court together.
eventAECBloodBroodBossSpawn_msg,gameevents,,,"BOSS: Mykir, The Executioner and The Headless arrive together."
