eventAECFivefoldCataclysmArrival_msg,gameevents,,false,"LEGENDARY: The order is set: Electric Demon, Hellskyli, The Executioner, The Witch, then Mykir."
eventAECFivefoldCataclysmElectricSpawn_msg,gameevents,,false,PHASE 1: The Electric Demon tears into the field first.
eventAECFivefoldCataclysmHellskyliSpawn_msg,gameevents,,false,PHASE 2: Hellskyli descends as the ground is still burning.
eventAECFivefoldCataclysmExecutionerSpawn_msg,gameevents,,false,PHASE 3: The Executioner marches in to finish what the flames began.
eventAECFivefoldCataclysmWitchSpawn_msg,gameevents,,false,PHASE 4: The Witch reveals herself before the final descent.
eventAECFivefoldCataclysmMykirSpawn_msg,gameevents,,false,FINAL PHASE: Mykir enters last. End the chain or be buried by it.
