itemAECApexCollapseContract_desc,,,false,"A legendary wilderness contract. The Druid, Hammer Guardian, Siren Head, and Mykir all converge on the same marked ground."
itemAECRedWeddingContract,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC Hazard 7 |[-] [FFD700]Legendary Contract | The Red Wedding[-]
itemAECRedWeddingContract_desc,,,false,"A legendary wilderness contract. The Dumdum twins open the ceremony, The Witch seals it, and Hellskyli descends to finish the rite."
itemAECElderCataclysmContract,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC Hazard 7 |[-] [FFD700]Legendary Contract | Elder Cataclysm[-]
itemAECElderCataclysmContract_desc,,,false,"A legendary wilderness contract. The Electric Demon, Hellskyli, The Druid, and Mykir form an old-world collapse chain."
itemAECBroodAndGallowsContract,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC Hazard 7 |[-] [FFD700]Legendary Contract | Brood and Gallows[-]
itemAECBroodAndGallowsContract_desc,,,false,"A legendary wilderness contract. Mykir's brood comes first, then executioner cultists, then The Executioner and Mykir themselves."
itemAECTheFalseApocalypseContract,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC Hazard 7 |[-] [FFD700]Legendary Contract | The False Apocalypse[-]
itemAECTheFalseApocalypseContract_desc,,,false,"A legendary wilderness contract. The Ghost, The Mechanician, Siren Head, and The Electric Demon combine into a staged end-of-world hunt."
