aecQuestGuideBtnText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]AEC AIO BOSS — QUEST GUIDE[-]
aecBossPartsHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,Boss parts drop from every contract reward airdrop.
aecBossPartsTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── BOSS PARTS ──[-]
aecBossPartsLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Parts include: Head, Arm, Leg, Torso and a rare Heart"
aecBossPartsLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,They can be sold to any trader for extra income
aecBossPartsLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,The Heart is the rarest and most valuable drop
aecBossPartsLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,[AAAAAA]Future update: parts will craft AEC armor and weapons[-]
aecBossPartsLine5Text,dialogs,Dialog,,[AAAAAA]AEC gear requires tiered mutation samples from matching boss families.[-]
