aecQuestBossDefenseBtnText,dialogs,Dialog,,Boss Defense Quest
aecQuestMinionPatrolBtnText,dialogs,Dialog,,Minion Patrol Quest
aecQuestMinionAssaultBtnText,dialogs,Dialog,,Minion Assault Quest
aecQuestSpecialBtnText,dialogs,Dialog,,Special Quests
aecQuestBackGuideText,dialogs,Dialog,,[AAAAAA]← Back to Quest Guide[-]
aecQuestBossHuntHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,Wilderness contract — no marked location required.
aecQuestBossHuntTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── BOSS HUNT ──[-]
aecQuestBossHuntLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,1. Place the signal lure from your inventory
aecQuestBossHuntLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,2. Survive 3 or more escalating enemy waves
aecQuestBossHuntLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,3. Kill the boss when it spawns
aecQuestBossHuntLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,4. Airdrop lands automatically at completion
aecQuestBossDefenseHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,POI-based contract — reach the location first.
aecQuestBossDefenseTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── BOSS DEFENSE ──[-]
aecQuestBossDefenseLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,1. Reach the marked POI location
aecQuestBossDefenseLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,2. Clear all sleepers inside the POI
aecQuestBossDefenseLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,3. Survive 3 or more incoming enemy waves
aecQuestBossDefenseLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,4. Kill the boss when it breaches
aecQuestBossDefenseLine5Text,dialogs,Dialog,,5. Airdrop lands automatically at completion
aecQuestMinionPatrolHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,Lightweight wilderness minion contract.
aecQuestMinionPatrolTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── MINION PATROL ──[-]
aecQuestMinionPatrolLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,1. Place the signal lure from your inventory
aecQuestMinionPatrolLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,2. Survive 3 or more minion patrol waves
aecQuestMinionPatrolLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,3. No boss kill required
aecQuestMinionPatrolLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,4. Airdrop lands automatically at completion
aecQuestMinionAssaultHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,POI-based minion contract — no boss kill required.
aecQuestMinionAssaultTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── MINION ASSAULT ──[-]
aecQuestMinionAssaultLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,1. Reach the marked POI location
aecQuestMinionAssaultLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,2. Clear all sleepers inside the POI
aecQuestMinionAssaultLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,3. Survive 3 or more minion assault waves
aecQuestMinionAssaultLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,4. No boss kill required
aecQuestMinionAssaultLine5Text,dialogs,Dialog,,5. Airdrop lands automatically at completion
aecQuestSpecialHeader,dialogs,Dialog,,Unique contracts with special rules and higher rewards.
aecQuestSpecialTitleText,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── SPECIAL QUESTS ──[-]
aecQuestSpecialLine1Text,dialogs,Dialog,,Multi-boss: kill 2 or more bosses in sequence
aecQuestSpecialLine2Text,dialogs,Dialog,,Twin boss: face 2 bosses at the same time
aecQuestSpecialLine3Text,dialogs,Dialog,,Higher risk — more mutation samples and better airdrop rewards.
aecQuestSpecialLine4Text,dialogs,Dialog,,Some specials have no wave pattern — kill on sight
