questAECMushroomHordeMinion_offer,,,false,These fungal freaks are spreading faster than we can contain them. Trigger the lure and hold through three timed waves.
questAECMushroomHordeMinion_statement,,,false,Hold through three timed Mushroom waves. Don't let them overwhelm you.
questAECMushroomHordeMinion_response,,,false,Contract accepted. I'll handle the mushroom horde.
questAECMushroomHordeMinion_completion,,,false,Colony cleared. The spores have stopped spreading — for now.
