questAECMushroomHunt_name,,,false,Mushroom Boss — Hunt
questAECMushroomHunt_subtitle,,,false,Hunt and Kill the Mushroom Boss
questAECMushroomHunt_description,,,false,Deploy the signal lure. Survive two timed waves of minions — then face the Mushroom Boss itself.
questAECMushroomHunt_offer,,,false,"The Mushroom Boss is out there. Its colony is expanding and its drain power is unlike anything I've seen. Survive the escorts, then put it down."
questAECMushroomHunt_statement,,,false,"Survive the minion escort, then kill the Mushroom Boss. Don't let it drain you dry."
questAECMushroomHunt_response,,,false,Contract accepted. The Mushroom Boss dies today.
questAECMushroomHunt_completion,,,false,The Mushroom Boss is dead. The colony will scatter without its core.
questAECMushroomHunt_obj_wave1,,,false,Survive guard wave 1
questAECMushroomHunt_obj_wave2,,,false,Survive guard wave 2
questAECMushroomHunt_obj_boss,,,false,Kill the Mushroom Boss
itemAECMushroomMinionPatrolContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 1 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | Minion Patrol[-]
itemAECMushroomMinionPatrolContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Survive a timed patrol wave of Mushroom spore-walkers. Deploy the signal lure to begin.
itemAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOIContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 1 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | POI Patrol[-]
itemAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOIContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Clear a spore-walker position, then survive the responding patrol wave."
itemAECMushroomMinionAssaultContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 2 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | Minion Assault[-]
itemAECMushroomMinionAssaultContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Survive two timed assault waves of Mushroom spore-walkers. Deploy the signal lure to begin.
itemAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOIContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 2 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | POI Assault[-]
itemAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOIContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Clear a fungal nest then survive two timed assault waves.
itemAECMushroomHordeMinionPOIContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | POI Horde[-]
itemAECMushroomHordeMinionPOIContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Breach a fortified location and survive three timed waves of the Mushroom horde.
itemAECMushroomHuntPOIContract,,,false,[FFD700]AEC Hazard 4 |[-] [FFD700]Mushroom Contract | POI Hunt[-]
itemAECMushroomHuntPOIContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Fight through the Mushroom Boss's timed guard waves in its lair, then destroy the core."
itemAECMushroomT1Bundle,,,false,Mushroom Spore Cache (T1)
itemAECMushroomT1Bundle_desc,,,false,A small supply drop for eliminating a mushroom patrol. Contains basic resources.
itemAECMushroomT2Bundle,,,false,Mushroom Spore Cache (T2)
itemAECMushroomT2Bundle_desc,,,false,A supply drop for repelling a mushroom assault. Contains improved resources.
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_name,,,false,Mushroom Patrol
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_subtitle,,,false,Eliminate the Spore-Walker Scouts
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_description,,,false,A small patrol of mushroom minions has been spotted nearby. Lure them out and survive the patrol wave before the infection spreads.
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_offer,,,false,We've spotted spore-walkers moving in the area. Use this signal lure to draw them in and hold through the patrol wave.
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_statement,,,false,"Deploy the lure, wait for the patrol to arrive, then survive the wave."
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_response,,,false,Understood. I'll hold through the patrol.
questAECMushroomMinionPatrol_completion,,,false,The patrol wave is broken. Good work keeping the infestation in check.
questAECMushroom_obj_patrol,,,false,Survive the Spore-Walker patrol
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_name,,,false,Mushroom Patrol (POI)
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_subtitle,,,false,Clear the Fungal Scouts
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_description,,,false,"Spore-walkers have taken over a nearby location. Move in, clear the area, and hold through the patrol wave when it arrives."
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_offer,,,false,"There's a fungal presence at a location nearby. Get in there, clear the building, and survive the patrol wave that responds."
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_statement,,,false,"Navigate to the location, clear the sleepers, then survive the patrol wave."
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_response,,,false,On my way. I'll clear it out.
questAECMushroomMinionPatrolPOI_completion,,,false,Location cleared. The patrol wave is broken.
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_name,,,false,Mushroom Assault
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_subtitle,,,false,Repel Two Waves of Spore-Walkers
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_description,,,false,A larger spore-walker formation is converging. Set up at the signal point and survive two timed assault waves.
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_offer,,,false,This isn't just a patrol — it's full assault formation. Get to position and hold through two timed waves.
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_statement,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive the first wave, then hold through the second. Don't break position."
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_response,,,false,I'll hold the line.
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_completion,,,false,Both assault waves broken. The spore-walkers are retreating.
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_name,,,false,Mushroom Assault (POI)
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_subtitle,,,false,Clear the Nest and Repel Assault Waves
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_description,,,false,A spore-walker nest has been identified at a POI. Clear the building and survive two timed reinforcement waves.
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_offer,,,false,That location has become a staging area. Clear the fungals inside and repel the counter-attack.
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_statement,,,false,"Enter the POI, clear sleepers, then hold through two timed assault waves."
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_response,,,false,Moving to the objective.
questAECMushroomMinionAssaultPOI_completion,,,false,Nest cleared and both assault waves routed. The location is secure.
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_name,,,false,Mushroom Horde (POI)
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_subtitle,,,false,Survive the Fungal Horde in the Field
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_description,,,false,The mushroom horde has entrenched at a fortified location. Breach it and survive three escalating timed waves.
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_offer,,,false,"The horde is using a location as a rally point. Take it from them, then hold through all three timed waves."
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_statement,,,false,"Get to the POI, clear it out, then survive all three timed horde waves. This won't be pretty."
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_response,,,false,Three waves in a POI. I'll make it out.
questAECMushroomHordeMinionPOI_completion,,,false,Three waves. All of them gone. The POI is ours now.
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_name,,,false,Mushroom Boss Hunt (POI)
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_subtitle,,,false,Destroy the Core in Its Lair
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_description,,,false,The Mushroom Boss has taken residence in a fortified POI. Fight through its timed escort waves and destroy it before it fully colonizes the location.
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_offer,,,false,"The Boss isn't wandering this time — it's dug in. Get there, fight through its timed guards, and rip out the core."
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_statement,,,false,"Clear the POI, survive two timed escort waves, then kill the Mushroom Boss. Don't let it drain you."
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_response,,,false,Moving to its lair. The Boss dies today.
questAECMushroomHuntPOI_completion,,,false,The Mushroom Boss is dead in its own lair. The colony has nowhere left to rally.
