itemAECArcherT1Bundle_desc,,,false,A small reward cache dropped after clearing an Archer patrol. Contains basic supplies and Archer fragments.
itemAECArcherMinionAssaultContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 2 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | Minion Assault[-]
itemAECArcherMinionAssaultContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Repel a full Archer assault in the wilderness. Survive three timed waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
itemAECArcherMinionAssaultPOIContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 2 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | POI Assault[-]
itemAECArcherMinionAssaultPOIContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Clear an Archer-held site, survive three timed reinforcement waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
itemAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssaultContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 2 |[-] [FFD700]Joint Contract | Mixed Assault[-]
itemAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssaultContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Repel a coordinated Doomlord and Archer assault force in the wilderness. Survive three timed mixed waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
itemAECArcherHordeContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | Horde[-]
itemAECArcherHordeContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Hold against a full Archer horde in the wilderness. Survive four timed waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
itemAECArcherHordePOIContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | POI Horde[-]
itemAECArcherHordePOIContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Clear an Archer strongpoint, survive four timed horde waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
itemAECDoomlordArcherHordeContract,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC Hazard 3 |[-] [FFD700]Joint Contract | Mixed Horde[-]
itemAECDoomlordArcherHordeContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Survive a large mixed horde of Doomlord troops and Archer raiders. Hold four timed waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
itemAECArcherT2Bundle,,,false,Archer Supply Cache (T2)
itemAECArcherT2Bundle_desc,,,false,A reinforced supply drop earned by breaking an Archer assault.
itemAECArcherT3Bundle,,,false,Archer War Cache (T3)
itemAECArcherT3Bundle_desc,,,false,A heavier reward crate dropped after destroying an Archer horde.
itemAECDoomlordArcherWarbandContract,,,false,[FFD700]AEC Hazard 4 |[-] [FFD700]Joint Contract | Warband[-]
itemAECDoomlordArcherWarbandContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Draw in a five-wave mixed Doomlord and Archer warband in the wilderness. Survive the full special assault exactly as currently structured.
itemAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOIContract,,,false,[FFD700]AEC Hazard 4 |[-] [FFD700]Joint Contract | Warband Strongpoint[-]
itemAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOIContract_desc,,,false,Contract: Clear a contested strongpoint and survive five mixed Doomlord and Archer counterattack waves in the current special format.
itemAECArcherHuntContract,,,false,[FF0000]AEC Hazard 5 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | Hunt[-]
itemAECArcherHuntContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Survive six Archer minion waves in the wilderness, then kill the Archer Boss."
itemAECArcherSiegeContract,,,false,[FF0000]AEC Hazard 5 |[-] [FFD700]Archer Contract | Siege[-]
itemAECArcherSiegeContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Clear a contested site, endure six Archer reinforcement waves, then defeat the Archer Boss."
itemAECArcherContract_100waveschallenge_deadeyegauntlet,,,false,[FFA500]AEC 100 waves super-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]Archer Deadeye Gauntlet[-]
itemAECArcherContract_100waveschallenge_deadeyegauntlet_desc,,,false,"Survive 100 non-linear Archer waves built from pure bow lines, low crossbow kill zones, incendiary and explosive volleys, full firing-line crossfire, and a final duel against the Archer Boss."
itemAECDoomlordArcherLastStandContract,,,false,[C77DFF]AEC Hazard 6 |[-] [FFD700]Joint Contract | Last Stand[-]
itemAECDoomlordArcherLastStandContract_desc,,,false,"Contract: Survive seven mixed Doomlord and Archer waves, then defeat both bosses at once."
itemAECArcherT4Bundle,,,false,Archer War Cache (T4)
itemAECArcherT4Bundle_desc,,,false,A heavy crate dropped after destroying a mixed Archer warband.
itemAECArcherT5Bundle,,,false,Archer Boss Cache (T5)
itemAECArcherT5Bundle_desc,,,false,A high-value reward crate dropped after killing the Archer Boss.
itemAECArcherT6Bundle,,,false,Archer Final Cache (T6)
itemAECArcherT6Bundle_desc,,,false,An elite reward crate dropped after surviving the final mixed boss contract.
itemAECAllInOneHuntContract,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC Hazard 9 |[-] [FFD700]The All-In-One Hunt[-]
itemAECAllInOneHuntContract_desc,,,false,Legendary contract | deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive the full endgame boss gauntlet. Each pair is scheduled around a 120 second phase window.
itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100waveshardchallenge,,,false,[FF0000]AEC 100 waves hard-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The minions army[-]
itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100waveshardchallenge_desc,,,false,"Endgame contract | deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive 100 crossed waves made of AEC minions only, with selected vanilla reinforcements. No boss spawns in this challenge."
itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100wavesextremechallenge,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC 100 waves extreme-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The minions army[-]
itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100wavesextremechallenge_desc,,,false,Extreme contract | deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive 100 crossed waves where every even wave summons one random boss from the full AEC boss cluster.
itemAECAllInOneHuntBundle,,,false,All-In-One Final Cache
itemAECAllInOneHuntBundle_desc,,,false,The reward crate dropped for clearing the full All-In-One boss hunt.
questAECAllInOneHunt_name,,,false,[FF0000]T[-][FF7F00]h[-][FFFF00]e[-] [00FF00]A[-][00BFFF]l[-][0000FF]l[-]-[8B00FF]I[-][FF1493]n[-]-[FF0000]O[-][FF7F00]n[-][FFFF00]e[-] [00FF00]H[-][00BFFF]u[-][0000FF]n[-][8B00FF]t[-]
questAECAllInOneHunt_subtitle,,,false,Deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive every boss pair
questAECAllInOneHunt_description,,,false,"This is the end of the line. Place the All-In-One Lure in the wilderness, hold the ground for the opening countdown, then eliminate every active boss pair in sequence."
questAECAllInOneHunt_offer,,,false,You wanted every major threat in one place. Here it is. Plant the All-In-One Lure and be ready to stand there when the sky starts answering back.
questAECAllInOneHunt_statement,,,false,"Place the lure, survive the timed sequence, and kill every boss pair before the gauntlet reaches its final wave."
questAECAllInOneHunt_response,,,false,"Then take the contract. If you finish it, there won't be a higher one left to offer."
questAECAllInOneHunt_completion,,,false,The whole line came for you and broke on your position.
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_name,,,false,[00E5FF]AEC 100 waves hard-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The minions army[-]
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_subtitle,,,false,No boss. Every AEC minion. 100 crossed waves.
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_description,,,false,Place the All-In-One Lure in the wilderness and hold the area through 100 crossed waves made from the full AEC minion roster. The escort pressure stays mixed and no boss enters the field.
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_offer,,,false,You asked for the whole minion roster without bosses. Fine. Plant the All-In-One Lure and survive the full crossed-wave army.
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_statement,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive every crossed wave, and hold until the complete Minions Army finishes its push."
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_response,,,false,"Take it then. If you clear this one, you did it against the full AEC minion line, not a boss shortcut."
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_completion,,,false,You held against the full Minions Army and no boss was needed to break you.
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_name,,,false,[8B00FF]AEC 100 waves extreme-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The bosses army[-]
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_subtitle,,,false,Even waves call one random AEC boss. 100 crossed waves.
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_description,,,false,Place the All-In-One Lure in the wilderness and hold the area through 100 crossed waves. Every even wave replaces the minion push with one random boss from the full AEC boss cluster.
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_offer,,,false,"You wanted the hard Minions Army to stop playing fair. Fine. Plant the All-In-One Lure and face the crossed waves again, but every even wave now rolls a random boss."
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_statement,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive the crossed waves, and endure the random boss rotation on every even wave until wave 100 breaks."
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_response,,,false,"Take it. If you finish this one, you cleared the Minions Army with the whole boss cluster cutting into every even wave."
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_completion,,,false,You held through the full Minions Army pattern even while the boss cluster kept breaking into the even waves.
