buffAECArcherBossPlayerAura,,,false,!! ARCHER BOSS
buffAECArcherBossPlayerAura_desc,,,false,The Archer Boss is within range. Watch for incoming arrows.
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_name,quests,,false,Archer Scout Patrol
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_subtitle,quests,,false,Survive the Archer Scout Waves
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Clear the Archer Forward Position
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_description,quests,,false,"Archer scouts have been spotted probing the area. Deploy the lure, survive two timed response waves, then kill 2 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_offer,quests,,false,"We've got Archer scouts testing our perimeter. Use the lure, draw them in, and hold through every wave."
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_statement,quests,,false,"Deploy the lure, hold through two scout waves, then kill 2 zombies from the last push."
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_response,quests,,false,I'll hold through the scout waves.
questAECArcherMinionPatrol_completion,quests,,false,The Archer patrol has been broken.
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_name,quests,,false,Archer Scout Patrol - Forward Position
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_description,quests,,false,"Archer scouts have taken over a nearby position. Clear the location, survive two timed patrol waves, then kill 2 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_offer,quests,,false,"A nearby site has become an Archer lookout. Go in, clear it, and hold when reinforcements arrive."
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_statement,quests,,false,"Clear the site first, hold through two scout waves, then kill 2 zombies from the last push."
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_response,quests,,false,Moving on the forward position now.
questAECArcherMinionPatrolPOI_completion,quests,,false,The forward position is clear and the Archer patrol has been broken.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_name,quests,,false,Joint Patrol — Doomlord & Archer
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_description,quests,,false,"Doomlord troops and Archer scouts have been spotted operating together. Survive two timed mixed patrol waves, then kill 2 zombies from the final push."
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_offer,quests,,false,We've got two different factions working together out there. Doomlord soldiers and those green archer things. Draw them in and hold your ground.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_statement,quests,,false,"Two threats, one operation. I'll hold two mixed waves, then kill 2 zombies from the last push."
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_response,quests,,false,I'll hold through the mixed patrol.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionPatrol_completion,quests,,false,The mixed patrol is broken. Good field control.
questAECArcherMinionAssault_name,quests,,false,Archer Assault
questAECArcherMinionAssault_subtitle,quests,,false,Survive the Archer Assault
questAECArcherMinionAssault_description,quests,,false,"Archer raiders are converging in force. Deploy the lure, survive three timed assault waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECArcherMinionAssault_offer,quests,,false,"This is no scout screen. Use the lure, draw them in, and hold through the full assault."
questAECArcherMinionAssault_statement,quests,,false,"Deploy the lure, hold through three assault waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECArcherMinionAssault_response,quests,,false,I'll hold the line.
questAECArcherMinionAssault_completion,quests,,false,The Archer assault has been smashed.
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_name,quests,,false,Archer Assault - Forward Position
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Clear the Position and Hold
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_description,quests,,false,"An Archer-held position has to be cleared first. Take the site, survive three timed reinforcement waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_offer,quests,,false,"Push into the Archer position, clear it, and be ready when the counterattack lands."
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_statement,quests,,false,"I'll clear the position, hold through three assault waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_response,quests,,false,Moving on the position now.
questAECArcherMinionAssaultPOI_completion,quests,,false,The position held. The Archer assault is broken.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_name,quests,,false,Joint Assault - Doomlord & Archer
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_description,quests,,false,"Doomlord troops are pushing in while Archer raiders screen their advance. Survive three timed heavy mixed assault waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_offer,quests,,false,This is no patrol. Doomlord muscle and Archer raiders are coming together in force. Hold the line through every wave.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_statement,quests,,false,"Deploy the lure, hold through three heavy mixed waves, then kill 3 zombies from the final breach."
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_response,quests,,false,I'll hold the mixed assault.
questAECDoomlordArcherMinionAssault_completion,quests,,false,The mixed assault has been smashed. The field is yours again.
questAECArcherHorde_name,quests,,false,Archer Horde
questAECArcherHorde_subtitle,quests,,false,Break the Archer Warband
questAECArcherHorde_description,quests,,false,"A large Archer warband is converging on your position. Use the lure, survive four timed waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherHorde_offer,quests,,false,"Scouts were one thing. This is the full warband. Set the lure, dig in, and break every wave they send."
questAECArcherHorde_statement,quests,,false,"Expect a long fight. Hold four waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherHorde_response,quests,,false,Understood. I'll break the horde.
questAECArcherHorde_completion,quests,,false,The Archer horde is broken. Good kill zone.
questAECArcherHordePOI_name,quests,,false,Archer Horde - Strongpoint
questAECArcherHordePOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Clear the Strongpoint and Hold
questAECArcherHordePOI_description,quests,,false,"An Archer strongpoint has been identified nearby. Clear the position, survive four timed horde waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherHordePOI_offer,quests,,false,"They've fortified a nearby site. Push in, clear it, and be ready when the warband comes back for it."
questAECArcherHordePOI_statement,quests,,false,"Take the strongpoint, hold four heavy reinforcement waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECArcherHordePOI_response,quests,,false,Moving on the strongpoint now.
questAECArcherHordePOI_completion,quests,,false,Strongpoint clear. Horde broken.
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_name,quests,,false,Mixed Horde - Doomlord & Archer
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_subtitle,quests,,false,Break the Joint Warband
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_description,quests,,false,"Doomlord troops and Archer raiders are marching together in strength. Draw them in, survive four timed mixed waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_offer,quests,,false,We've got a serious problem. Doomlord troops are advancing with Archer support in numbers. Set the trap and wipe the whole column.
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_statement,quests,,false,"Expect four escalating mixed waves, then kill 4 zombies from the final push."
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_response,quests,,false,I'll break the joint warband.
questAECDoomlordArcherHorde_completion,quests,,false,The mixed warband is down. That should slow them for a while.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_name,quests,,false,Mixed Warband - Doomlord & Archer
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_subtitle,quests,,false,Break the Five-Wave Warband
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_description,quests,,false,A full mixed warband of Doomlord troops and Archer raiders is converging in the wilderness. Survive five escalating special-format waves and wipe them out.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_offer,quests,,false,This one is bigger. Doomlord troops and Archer raiders are marching as a full warband. Draw them out and grind through all five waves.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_statement,quests,,false,Expect a sustained mixed assault. Hold through five waves and kill every last raider.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_response,quests,,false,I'll break the warband.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarband_completion,quests,,false,The mixed warband is destroyed. Good field control.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_name,quests,,false,Mixed Warband - Strongpoint
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_subtitle,quests,,false,Hold the Strongpoint
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_description,quests,,false,A nearby strongpoint is drawing a large mixed Doomlord and Archer response. Clear the site and survive five special-format counterattack waves.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_offer,quests,,false,"Take the position, then brace for a full mixed counterpush. This one will not stop after three waves."
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_statement,quests,,false,Clear the strongpoint first. Then hold it through five mixed waves.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_response,quests,,false,Understood. I'll hold the position.
questAECDoomlordArcherWarbandPOI_completion,quests,,false,The strongpoint held. The mixed warband is broken.
questAECArcherHunt_name,quests,,false,Archer Boss Hunt
questAECArcherHunt_subtitle,quests,,false,"Survive the Waves, Kill the Boss"
questAECArcherHunt_description,quests,,false,"Archer minions are screening their master. Survive six increasingly heavy minion waves, then kill the Archer Boss when it joins the fight."
questAECArcherHunt_offer,quests,,false,"The minions come first, but the real target is their leader. Break the waves and the Archer Boss will show itself."
questAECArcherHunt_statement,quests,,false,"Six pure Archer minion waves, then the boss. Stay alive long enough to finish the job."
questAECArcherHunt_response,quests,,false,I'll bring the Archer Boss down.
questAECArcherHunt_completion,quests,,false,The Archer Boss is dead. The hunt is over.
questAECArcherSiege_name,quests,,false,Archer Boss Siege
questAECArcherSiege_subtitle,quests,,false,Hold the Site Against the Boss
questAECArcherSiege_description,quests,,false,"An Archer siege is forming against a nearby position. Clear the site, survive six minion waves, then kill the Archer Boss."
questAECArcherSiege_offer,quests,,false,"This is a full siege. Push into the site, hold against the minion waves, and kill the Archer Boss when it arrives."
questAECArcherSiege_statement,quests,,false,Take the site. Survive six waves. End the siege by killing the boss.
questAECArcherSiege_response,quests,,false,Moving to the site now.
questAECArcherSiege_completion,quests,,false,The siege is broken. Archer Boss eliminated.
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_name,quests,,false,Last Stand - Doomlord & Archer
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_subtitle,quests,,false,Survive the Joint Final Assault
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_description,quests,,false,"A final mixed offensive is building. Survive seven Doomlord and Archer waves, then defeat both bosses when they attack together."
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_offer,quests,,false,"This is the real endgame. Five mixed waves, then both the Doomlord and Archer bosses at once. If you take this, finish it."
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_statement,quests,,false,Hold through seven heavy mixed waves. Then kill both bosses in the same fight.
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_response,quests,,false,I'll hold and finish both of them.
questAECDoomlordArcherLastStand_completion,quests,,false,Both bosses are down. The last stand is over.
