itemAECAllInOneHuntContract_T03,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC |[-] [FFD700]The All-In-One Hunt[-] [1★]
itemAECAllInOneHuntContract_desc_T03,,,false,Legendary contract | deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive the full endgame boss gauntlet. Each pair is scheduled around a 120 second phase window. [1★]
