itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100wavesextremechallenge_T03,,,false,[FF4DFF]AEC 100 waves extreme-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The minions army[-] [1★]
itemAECMinionsArmyContract_100wavesextremechallenge_desc_T03,,,false,Extreme contract | deploy the All-In-One Lure and survive 100 crossed waves where every even wave summons one random boss from the full AEC boss cluster. [1★]
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_completion_T03,,,false,You held through the full Minions Army pattern even while the boss cluster kept breaking into the even waves. [1★]
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_description_T03,,,false,Place the All-In-One Lure in the wilderness and hold the area through 100 crossed waves. Every even wave replaces the minion push with one random boss from the full AEC boss cluster. [1★]
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_name_T03,,,false,[8B00FF]AEC 100 waves extreme-challenge 0[FFD700]★[-] |[-] [FFD700]The bosses army[-] [1★]
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_offer_T03,,,false,"You wanted the hard Minions Army to stop playing fair. Fine. Plant the All-In-One Lure and face the crossed waves again, but every even wave now rolls a random boss. [1★]"
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_response_T03,,,false,"Take it. If you finish this one, you cleared the Minions Army with the whole boss cluster cutting into every even wave. [1★]"
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_statement_T03,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive the crossed waves, and endure the random boss rotation on every even wave until wave 100 breaks. [1★]"
questAECMinionsArmyExtremeChallenge_subtitle_T03,,,false,Even waves call one random AEC boss. 100 crossed waves. [1★]
