questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_completion_T03,,,false,You held against the full Minions Army and no boss was needed to break you. [1★]
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_description_T03,,,false,Place the All-In-One Lure in the wilderness and hold the area through 100 crossed waves made from the full AEC minion roster. The escort pressure stays mixed and no boss enters the field. [1★]
