questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_response_T03,,,false,"Take it then. If you clear this one, you did it against the full AEC minion line, not a boss shortcut. [1★]"
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_statement_T03,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive every crossed wave, and hold until the complete Minions Army finishes its push. [1★]"
questAECMinionsArmyHardChallenge_subtitle_T03,,,false,No boss. Every AEC minion. 100 crossed waves. [1★]
