questAECMushroomHunt_offer_T15,,,false,"The Mushroom Boss is out there. Its colony is expanding and its drain power is unlike anything I've seen. Survive the escorts, then put it down. [5★]"
questAECMushroomHunt_response_T15,,,false,Contract accepted. The Mushroom Boss dies today. [5★]
questAECMushroomHunt_statement_T15,,,false,"Survive the minion escort, then kill the Mushroom Boss. Don't let it drain you dry. [5★]"
questAECMushroomHunt_subtitle_T15,,,false,Hunt and Kill the Mushroom Boss [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_completion_T15,,,false,Both assault waves broken. The spore-walkers are retreating. [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_description_T15,,,false,A larger spore-walker formation is converging. Set up at the signal point and survive two timed assault waves. [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_name_T15,,,false,Mushroom Assault [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_offer_T15,,,false,This isn't just a patrol — it's full assault formation. Get to position and hold through two timed waves. [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_response_T15,,,false,I'll hold the line. [5★]
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_statement_T15,,,false,"Deploy the lure, survive the first wave, then hold through the second. Don't break position. [5★]"
questAECMushroomMinionAssault_subtitle_T15,,,false,Repel Two Waves of Spore-Walkers [5★]
